From 61c0defe517563a6cebdc4cfc6839dcd4065ac4e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 13:36:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] hw/arm: add efr32bg22 machine with out-of-process
 peripheral bridge

Cortex-M33 machine with 512K flash and 32K SRAM that resets at 0 (for a
bootloader image passed with -kernel). Peripheral window accesses are
forwarded over a chardev to tools/efr32bg22/server.py, which returns the
IRQ line levels and the next virtual-time deadline.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
